(text "NOR4_N16: four-input NOR, Y = ~(A | B | C | D). Two 6N16B, all four triode plates on Y, Ra 10k to +150 V (as NOR2_N16).\nA, B, C, D: LV (1 = +10 V, 0 = -20 V), each on a triode grid (divider C1 3.9 pF per grid). Y: HV; one divider per net.\nSimulated, fanout 2/6/10: Y falls 58-90 ns, rises 120/193/268 ns; VOL 55 V (one input) ... 27 V (all four).\nHeater 6.3 V: 2 x 0.4 A on H1/H2. Page: sch/logic/NOR4_N16/README.md" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 215.9 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0f239b46-b4c7-43cf-a5fe-5eb5b7162166"))

